demo/jaffle_shop and demo/raw_data are adapted from dbt-labs/jaffle_shop_duckdb
(https://github.com/dbt-labs/jaffle_shop_duckdb, commit 20cc904), licensed under the
Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE). VeriMend's fault suite injects faults into copies of it.

Changes from the original:
- The three seed files moved to demo/raw_data/. scripts/build_demo.py loads them into a
  `raw` schema of warehouse.duckdb with fixed column types, and the staging models read
  them with `source('raw', ...)` instead of `ref()`. There are no seeds.
- require-dbt-version allows dbt 1.10, the version VeriMend pins.
- The payment methods are a project var; `orders` reads them with `var()`.
- A macro, cents_to_dollars, converts payment amounts in stg_payments.
- The staging models have enforced contracts (column names and types).
- The marts moved to models/marts/. Two marts were added: daily_revenue and
  payment_method_totals, with their tests, and a not_null test on gift_card_amount.
- Five singular tests were added under tests/.
- Generic tests use `data_tests:`. The docs colours, overview page, Dockerfile and
  other files of the original are not included.
